<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>阳明之火大渴 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%98%B3%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%8B%E7%81%AB%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%B4/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mtcmp1fx</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:53:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E9%98%B3%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%8B%E7%81%AB%E5%A4%A7%E6%B8%B4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>缓治法：论阳明之火大渴 论大吐 论大泻</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-7-huanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Apr 2026 14:51:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-7-huanzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“缓治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;阳明火盛大渴、大吐、大泻及久虚&lt;/strong&gt;等病症的治法。核心思想是：某些看似急重之症，若峻猛急攻反伤正气，不如&lt;strong&gt;缓缓清补、徐徐调养&lt;/strong&gt;，使正气渐复而邪自退，即“缓治胜于急治”。</description></item></channel></rss>